{"id":"n17229-1-8","stage":1,"title":"기억나다 · 记起","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17229-1-8-1","ko":"어머, 너 민준이로구나. 나 기억나니?","zh":"哎呀，原来你是敏俊啊。还记得我吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이로구나.","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；로구나：对名词判断的新发现表示感叹：“原来是……啊”。","readings":[{"term":"민준이로구나","audio":"/audio/c3ceb770e941bcd33adb.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기억나니?","meaning":"记起，想起","explanation":"기억나다：记起，想起；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"기억나다","audio":"/audio/2c11a52327c9fb0eab24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17229","senseId":"1","lemma":"기억나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"2c11a52327c9fb0e","term":"기억나다","zh":"记起，想起","audio":"/audio/2c11a52327c9fb0eab24.mp3","entryId":"17229","definition":"在心中或脑海里浮现出以前的模样、事实、知识、经验等。","pronunciation":["기엉나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/612aeaac7c88dace2e05.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17229-1-8-2","ko":"와, 지수야. 우리 십 년 만에 보는구나. 정말 반갑다.","zh":"哇，智秀啊。我们十年没见了呢，真是太高兴了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"와,","meaning":"啊，咦","explanation":"와：啊，咦","readings":[{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17872","senseId":"1","lemma":"와","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수야.","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"지수야","audio":"/audio/933aef68208bc459c4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：十","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"년","meaning":"年","explanation":"년：年","readings":[{"term":"년","audio":"/audio/e23df8834a583975acd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26823","senseId":"1","lemma":"년","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만에","meaning":"表示过了一段时间。","explanation":"만：表示过了一段时间。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"만","audio":"/audio/0fa2841136f2a818a173.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50295","senseId":"1","lemma":"만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보는구나.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반갑다.","mea